Subject: [PATCH 01/17] tracing/uprobes: Fix documentation of uprobe registration syntax
Date: Mon, 16 Dec 2013 13:32:00 +0900
Message-Id: <1387168336-13213-2-git-send-email-namhyung@kernel.org>
